{"seq":3,"slug":"fx-fee-pricing","title":"换汇手续费与到账金额计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/international-pricing-currency/multicurrency-payment/fx-fee-pricing","wordCount":2395,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"换汇手续费与到账金额计算\">换汇手续费与到账金额计算</h1><p>用户付了 100 美元，公司账上到了 835 欧元——这两个数字之间的所有扣减项，构成了跨境交易的完整成本结构。本篇的目标是把这个结构写成可计算的公式，并给出代码化的实现边界：哪些扣减在收单时确定、哪些在结算时确定、哪些要等到批次生成才知道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-成本的完整分解\">核心概念：成本的完整分解</h2><p>一笔跨境交易的成本分成三类，发生在三个不同时点。要理解它们如何叠加，需要先看渠道给出的币种能力——成本结构里的换汇项是否存在，取决于结算币种与收单币种是否相同（见 <a href=\"../fx-conversion/display-vs-settle-currency\">展示币种与结算币种分离</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>计费方式</th>\n<th>确定时点</th>\n<th>币种</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收单侧</td>\n<td>渠道费率</td>\n<td>比例 + 固定值</td>\n<td>交易时</td>\n<td>结算币种或收单币种</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收单侧</td>\n<td>跨境费</td>\n<td>比例</td>\n<td>交易时</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收单侧</td>\n<td>卡组织评估费</td>\n<td>比例（按卡种/地区）</td>\n<td>交易时</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换汇侧</td>\n<td>换汇点差</td>\n<td>隐含在汇率里</td>\n<td>结算时</td>\n<td>无（体现为汇率差）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险侧</td>\n<td>拒付罚金</td>\n<td>固定值 + 原金额冲回</td>\n<td>发生后</td>\n<td>结算币种</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险侧</td>\n<td>退款</td>\n<td>全额或部分冲回</td>\n<td>发生后</td>\n<td>原交易币种</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个表最重要的一行是「换汇点差」——它是唯一一个<strong>以汇率形式而非金额形式出现</strong>的成本项。这一点决定了它的计算方式与前面所有项不同：它不是从金额里减掉一个数，而是让金额经过一个不利的汇率。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户支付: 1000 USD] --&gt; B[收单侧扣减]&#10;    B --&gt; F1[渠道费率]&#10;    B --&gt; F2[跨境费]&#10;    B --&gt; F3[卡组织评估费]&#10;    F1 --&gt; N[收单净额: 967.90 USD]&#10;    F2 --&gt; N&#10;    F3 --&gt; N&#10;    N --&gt; X{换汇}&#10;    X --&gt; R1[渠道报价汇率: 0.8605]&#10;    R1 --&gt; E[换汇后: 833.03 EUR]&#10;    E --&gt; Z[到账金额]&#10;    N -.-&gt;|市场中间价: 0.8700| R2[理论金额: 842.07 EUR]&#10;    R2 -.-&gt; D[点差成本: 9.04 EUR]\">graph TD\n    A[用户支付: 1000 USD] --&gt; B[收单侧扣减]\n    B --&gt; F1[渠道费率]\n    B --&gt; F2[跨境费]\n    B --&gt; F3[卡组织评估费]\n    F1 --&gt; N[收单净额: 967.90 USD]\n    F2 --&gt; N\n    F3 --&gt; N\n    N --&gt; X{换汇}\n    X --&gt; R1[渠道报价汇率: 0.8605]\n    R1 --&gt; E[换汇后: 833.03 EUR]\n    E --&gt; Z[到账金额]\n    N -.-&gt;|市场中间价: 0.8700| R2[理论金额: 842.07 EUR]\n    R2 -.-&gt; D[点差成本: 9.04 EUR]</pre><p>图中的虚线是理解换汇成本的关键：<strong>点差成本 = 按中间价换算的理论金额 − 按渠道汇率换算的实际金额</strong>。它不能从汇率本身直接读出——0.8605 与 0.8700 之间的差是 1.09%，但这个百分比要乘以金额才是成本。因此系统必须同时知道渠道汇率与一个参考中间价，才能计量点差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"到账金额的完整公式\">到账金额的完整公式</h2><p>把上面所有项写成一个公式。设交易金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>（收单币种，最小单位），渠道比例费率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，固定费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，跨境费比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，渠道汇率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>（结算币种 / 收单币种），参考中间价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>收单净额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{收单净额} = A \\cdot (1 - r_f - r_c) - c_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收单净额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>到账金额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>收单净额</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>settle_scale</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{到账金额} = \\text{round}\\big(\\text{收单净额} \\cdot e,\\; \\text{settle\\_scale}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">到账金额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收单净额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">settle_scale</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>点差成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>收单净额</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>收单净额</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{点差成本} = \\text{round}\\big(\\text{收单净额} \\cdot e_m,\\; s\\big) - \\text{round}\\big(\\text{收单净额} \\cdot e,\\; s\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">点差成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收单净额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收单净额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>settle_scale</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{settle\\_scale}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">settle_scale</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是结算币种的最小单位指数对应的因子。注意公式里两个 <code>round</code> 的舍入目标是同一个币种与同一精度，它们相减才有意义——如果理论金额按中间价舍入到 EUR 分、实际金额按渠道汇率舍入到 EUR 分，两者的差就是点差的真实成本（含舍入影响，通常可忽略）。</p>\n<p>一个具体的数字：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> USD，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.029</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_f = 0.029</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.029</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.006</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_c = 0.006</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.006</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_f = 0.30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8605</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e = 0.8605</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8605</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>收单净额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.029</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.006</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>964.70</mn><mtext> USD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{收单净额} = 1000 \\times (1 - 0.029 - 0.006) - 0.30 = 964.70 \\text{ USD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收单净额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.029</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.006</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">964.70</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> USD</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>到账金额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>964.70</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.8605</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>830.12</mn><mtext> EUR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{到账金额} = \\text{round}(964.70 \\times 0.8605, 2) = 830.12 \\text{ EUR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">到账金额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">964.70</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8605</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">830.12</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> EUR</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用中间价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8700</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_m = 0.8700</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8700</span></span></span></span></span> 计算理论金额是 839.29 EUR，点差成本约 9.17 EUR，相当于净额的 1.09%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"手续费用什么币种计\">手续费用什么币种计</h2><p>这是一个被低估的设计问题。渠道费率的计价币种有三种可能，结果不同：</p>\n<p><strong>以结算币种计费。</strong> 费率在扣减时已经折算到结算币种。这意味着扣减发生在换汇之后，换汇点差不影响手续费金额。</p>\n<p><strong>以收单币种计费。</strong> 费率以收单币种扣减，扣减后再换汇。这时期权费也承担了换汇点差——同样比例的费率，在点差大的币种上实际成本更高。</p>\n<p><strong>以第三方币种计费（通常是 USD）。</strong> 一些渠道对所有交易统一用 USD 计费，这意味着每笔交易都要单独做一次到 USD 的换算，点差第二次发生。</p>\n<p>三种模式的财务影响不同，因此系统里的「手续费」字段必须带币种，而不能只存一个数字。此外，<strong>手续费与交易本金在总账上应该是分开的科目</strong>：本金进收入，手续费进成本。如果渠道只提供净额（收到一笔 830.12 EUR 而不知道其中多少是费用），系统就只能把整笔记为收入并在期末估算成本，这会牺牲成本可见性。选择渠道时，「结算报告是否提供明细」应该是一个评价项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最低费用与小额商品的成本陷阱\">最低费用与小额商品的成本陷阱</h2><p>渠道费率通常有「比例 + 固定值」的形式，固定值部分对小额商品是致命的。一个 0.50 美元的商品，用 2.9% + 0.30 的费率计算（Stripe 的价格页即为此结构：按比例收费并单列换汇附加费，其日本标准卡费率为 3.6%，需要货币换算时另加 2%，见 <a href=\"https://stripe.com/pricing）：\">https://stripe.com/pricing）：</a></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>手续费</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0.50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.029</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3145</mn><mtext> USD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{手续费} = 0.50 \\times 0.029 + 0.30 = 0.3145 \\text{ USD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">手续费</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.029</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3145</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> USD</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>费用占交易额的 62.9%。这就是为什么渠道会设置最低交易金额——不是为了用户，而是为了自己不在小额交易上亏钱。</p>\n<p>对定价系统的含义是：<strong>固定费的存在让小额商品的本地定价需要单独的毛利率测算</strong>。一个在 USD 市场能盈利的价格，换算到另一个币种后可能因为最小单位导致金额更小（例如某些货币面值小），从而撞上固定费陷阱。这类问题在定价阶段就应该被计算出来，而不是在结算时才发现。</p>\n<p>反过来，这也提供了批量购买的定价依据：如果两件小额商品的固定费可以合并（同一笔交易），那么「买二送一运费」之类的策略在小额品类上的价值远高于大额品类。系统需要在定价工具里暴露「此价格下的手续费占比」这个指标给定价团队。</p>\n<h2 id=\"到账金额的三个可观测性要求\">到账金额的三个可观测性要求</h2><p>要让财务与支付团队能解释每一分钱的去向，到账金额的计算必须满足三个可观测性要求。</p>\n<p><strong>每一个扣减项都是独立字段。</strong> 不是记一个 <code>net_amount</code>，而是记 <code>gross</code>、<code>channel_fee</code>、<code>cross_border_fee</code>、<code>scheme_fee</code>、<code>fx_rate</code>、<code>fx_spread_cost</code>、<code>net</code>。字段之间的加减关系必须恒等成立（除舍入外），并且这个恒等式要作为运行时校验。</p>\n<p><strong>推算值必须标记为推算。</strong> 如果渠道不提供某项明细（比如不提供换汇汇率），系统只能用总额反推。这个反推值必须带一个 <code>is_derived</code> 标记，因为它在审计中不能作为原始凭证。财务审计时，「渠道报告上的数」与「我们算出来的数」的证据等级不同。</p>\n<p><strong>按维度聚合。</strong> 到账金额必须可以按「市场 × 渠道 × 币种 × 时间」聚合，用于回答「哪个市场的换汇成本最高」「哪个渠道的手续费异常」。这个聚合视图是定价团队调价、支付团队谈费率、财务团队做预算的共同输入。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[交易事件] --&gt; B[收单侧扣减明细]&#10;    B --&gt; C[计算收单净额]&#10;    C --&gt; D{结算币种 == 收单币种}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[无换汇, 到账 = 净额]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[应用渠道汇率]&#10;    F --&gt; G[计算点差成本]&#10;    G --&gt; H[到账金额]&#10;    E --&gt; I[写入结算明细行]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[恒等式校验: gross - fees = net]&#10;    J --&gt;|不成立| K[告警: 计算缺陷或数据缺失]&#10;    J --&gt;|成立| L[可按维度聚合]\">flowchart TD\n    A[交易事件] --&gt; B[收单侧扣减明细]\n    B --&gt; C[计算收单净额]\n    C --&gt; D{结算币种 == 收单币种}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[无换汇, 到账 = 净额]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[应用渠道汇率]\n    F --&gt; G[计算点差成本]\n    G --&gt; H[到账金额]\n    E --&gt; I[写入结算明细行]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[恒等式校验: gross - fees = net]\n    J --&gt;|不成立| K[告警: 计算缺陷或数据缺失]\n    J --&gt;|成立| L[可按维度聚合]</pre><h2 id=\"退款与拒付对成本的反向影响\">退款与拒付对成本的反向影响</h2><p>退款与拒付会让前面的计算反向运行，但<strong>费用不总是反向退还</strong>。这是最容易在成本测算中被忽略的一点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>本金</th>\n<th>渠道费率</th>\n<th>固定费</th>\n<th>跨境费</th>\n<th>换汇点差</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全额退款</td>\n<td>全额退回用户</td>\n<td>部分渠道退还</td>\n<td>多数不退还</td>\n<td>多数不退还</td>\n<td>已发生的换汇不退回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分退款</td>\n<td>按比例退回</td>\n<td>通常不退还</td>\n<td>不退还</td>\n<td>不退还</td>\n<td>已发生不退回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒付</td>\n<td>用户侧冲回</td>\n<td>不退还</td>\n<td>不退还</td>\n<td>不退还</td>\n<td>已发生不退回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒付罚金</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>拒付还有一笔额外的固定罚金，且不同卡组织与渠道的金额不同。这意味着<strong>拒付的成本远高于交易额本身</strong>：一笔 20 美元的交易被拒付，损失可能是 20 美元本金 + 费率 + 罚金，合计可能超过 40 美元。在做定价与风控预算时，「预期拒付率 × 单笔拒付成本」应该作为一个成本项加进有效成本率（见 <a href=\"acquire-in-local\">本地币种收单与渠道币种能力</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{eff}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 公式）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>换汇点差是唯一以「汇率」而非「金额」出现的成本项，计量方式是「中间价理论金额 − 渠道汇率实际金额」。</li>\n<li>到账金额 = (交易额 × (1 − 比例费率) − 固定费) × 渠道汇率，四舍五入到结算币种最小单位。</li>\n<li>手续费必须带币种存储；费率计价币种（结算币 / 收单币 / 第三方币）不同会改变实际成本，因为点差可能发生两次。</li>\n<li>固定费让小额商品的成本占比急剧上升，本地定价阶段就必须测算手续费占比并暴露给定价团队。</li>\n<li>到账金额的每个扣减项都应是独立字段，恒等式作为运行时校验；推算值标记 <code>is_derived</code>，因为证据等级低于渠道报告。</li>\n<li>退款与拒付时本金退回但多数费用不退还，拒付还有额外罚金；「预期拒付率 × 单笔拒付成本」应计入有效成本率。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"换汇手续费与到账金额计算","id":"换汇手续费与到账金额计算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：成本的完整分解","id":"核心概念-成本的完整分解"},{"level":2,"text":"到账金额的完整公式","id":"到账金额的完整公式"},{"level":2,"text":"手续费用什么币种计","id":"手续费用什么币种计"},{"level":2,"text":"最低费用与小额商品的成本陷阱","id":"最低费用与小额商品的成本陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"到账金额的三个可观测性要求","id":"到账金额的三个可观测性要求"},{"level":2,"text":"退款与拒付对成本的反向影响","id":"退款与拒付对成本的反向影响"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"结算换汇与记账币种","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/international-pricing-currency/multicurrency-payment/settlement-conversion"},"next":{"title":"关税/VAT 试算引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/international-pricing-currency/tax-checkout-ops/duty-tax-estimation"}}